# `swift package archive-source` builds a registry release from `git archive`,
# so `export-ignore` decides what a published version contains. Everything
# below is repository infrastructure: it gates changes here and is dead weight
# in a consumer's checkout.
#
# Nothing named in `Package.swift` may appear in this list. `Tests/` holds the
# `TmuxFixture` target and `Snippets/` holds the snippet targets, so ignoring
# either produces an archive whose manifest names sources that are not there.
dev/ export-ignore
Scripts/ export-ignore
Parity/ export-ignore
Benchmarks/ export-ignore
.github/ export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
.gitignore export-ignore
.mise.toml export-ignore
